... when identified becomes a cloak of random protection. a fairly fragile
item subject to shredding under extreme stress (ideas ed?). offers no
improvement in AC rating. has the magic ability to reduce the random factor
that afflicts other armor. near zero weight and may be worn over other rags
(without limit?) but not other cloaks. does not prevent the rusting of armor
beneath it. does not enchant. better shred resistance when blessed, worse
when cursed, prevents the removal of underlying armor until it is removed ...

example: AC=-24, eff AC= - 1 to -24 w/o rag.
                 eff AC= -11 to -24 w/ 1 rag.
                 eff AC= -21 to -24 w/ 2 rags.
                 eff AC= -24 w/ 3 or more rags.
